            "To contrast the demands of the speaker's\neveryday life with the serenity of being\nrocked to sleep by the ocean.",
            "To illustrate the increasing intensity of the\nspeaker's desire to escape ongoing\nhardship by gliding on the ocean.",
            "To convey the speaker's longing for the\nocean to impart a sense of inner\ntranquility."
          ],
          "answer": 3,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is D (Answer Key: Topic 8, Q22). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
        }
