          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 · Topic 8 · Q33",
          "passageTitle": "Main Purpose — Q33",
          "passage": "Founded in New York City in 1969, El Museo\ndel Barrio is dedicated to the visual arts and\ncultures of Latin America and of Latino\ncommunities in the United States. Since its\nfounding, it has acquired more than 8,500\nobjects for its permanent collection. More\nrecently founded US-based institutions devoted\nto Latino cultures include the Emma S.\nBarrientos Mexican American Cultural Center.\nLocated in Austin, Texas, it focuses on Mexican\nAmerican art and culture.",
